
After completing ALL work below, exit with: shark status advance E07-F01

Generate tasks for feature E07-F01: "Sample feature for golden test".

Check for existing tasks: shark list E07-F01 --json. If tasks exist covering all feature requirements with proper sequencing, advance immediately.

